Model Thresholding Analysis in PySpark — v2

Updates from v1:

- Upper threshold now targets a volume BAND (4,500–5,500) rather than a single point
- Finds per-month scores at lower bound, midpoint, and upper bound of the band
- Picks final threshold conservatively (stays inside band even on worst month)
- Added 80% variant of the band as an alternative output
- Assumes input dataset has columns: PARTY_KEY, scoring_date, xgb_scr
